  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.01 Adjudicative proceeding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.01 “Adjudicative proceeding” means a proceeding that is conducted pursuant to the procedure followed in contested cases set forth in RSA 541-A:31 through RSA 541-A:36 and the Puc 200 rules of the commission.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
